-- ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
-- SECTION 4: FORMATTING REFERENCE
-- ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

-- VND Currency format string (Format pane → Custom):
--   #,##0 "₫"

-- Percentage format:
--   0.0%

-- Date format (Vietnamese locale):
--   DD/MM/YYYY

-- Large number display (in KPI card → Format → Display units):
--   Set to "Thousands" or "Millions" depending on scale

-- Conditional formatting thresholds:
--   Net Cashflow        : < 0           → Red (#E74C3C)
--                       : >= 0          → Green (#2ECC71)
--   Payment Rate %      : < 70%         → Red
--                       : 70% – 90%    → Amber (#F39C12)
--                       : > 90%         → Green
--   Outstanding Rate %  : > 10%         → Red background on cell
--   Days Overdue        : > 60 days     → Bold red font in table

-- ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
-- COLOR PALETTE (for consistent cross-dashboard theming)
-- ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
-- VIP Gold:           #F1C40F
-- Growing Green:      #27AE60
-- Positive Green:     #2ECC71
-- Warning Amber:      #F39C12
-- Danger Red:         #E74C3C
-- Needs Attn Orange:  #E67E22
-- At Risk Red:        #C0392B
-- Lost Gray:          #7F8C8D
-- Neutral Gray:       #95A5A6
-- Accent Blue:        #3498DB
-- Dark Navy BG:       #1A2332
-- Card Background:    #243447
-- White Text:         #ECF0F1
